<script setup>
// 从 App.vue 拆出来的一块界面：状态和函数都在 App 里，按同样的名字 inject 进来，模板原样不动
import { inject } from 'vue'
import { ChevronDown, Image as ImageIcon, LoaderCircle, Palette, SlidersHorizontal, X } from 'lucide-vue-next'
import FileManager from '../settings/FileManager.vue'
import ImageReference from '../chat/ImageReference.vue'
import MemoryPanel from '../settings/MemoryPanel.vue'
import ModelSettings from '../settings/ModelSettings.vue'
import StylePicker from '../settings/StylePicker.vue'
const {
  addComponent, brief, closeDialog, colors, componentInput, componentList, createProject, dialog,
  dialogBusy, dialogError, dialogType, edit, fileManagerRevision, filesChanged, formatTime, imageInput,
  importSpecTokens, keepInspector, locked, memoryCount, model, openManagedProject, page, project,
  projectName, reference, removeComponent, removeSkill, restore, saveSpec, skillList, sourceInfo,
  specDraft, specInput, specNotice, specSaved, specTab, undoCount, useReference,
  styleList, styleInput, newStyle, importStyle, changeStyle
} = inject('studio')
</script>

<template>
<dialog ref="dialog" class="studio-dialog" :class="{ 'image-dialog': dialogType === 'image', 'files-dialog': dialogType === 'files', 'new-dialog': dialogType === 'new', 'style-dialog': dialogType === 'spec' && specTab === 'style' }" @cancel="dialogBusy && $event.preventDefault()" @click="($event.target === dialog) && closeDialog()">
  <div class="dialog-header"><h2>{{ dialogType === 'settings' ? $t('模型') : dialogType === 'history' ? $t('版本历史') : dialogType === 'image' ? $t('截图圈选') : dialogType === 'files' ? $t('文件管理') : dialogType === 'palette' ? $t('项目配色') : dialogType === 'spec' ? $t('设计规范') : $t('新建原型') }}</h2><button class="icon-button" :aria-label="$t('关闭弹窗')" :disabled="dialogBusy" @click="closeDialog"><X :size="19" /></button></div>
  <input ref="styleInput" type="file" class="sr-only" accept=".zip,application/zip,application/x-zip-compressed" @change="importStyle" />
  <FileManager v-if="dialogType === 'files'" :key="fileManagerRevision" :current-project-id="project?.id" @changed="filesChanged" @open="openManagedProject" @busy="dialogBusy = $event" />
  <div v-else-if="dialogType === 'image' && reference"><ImageReference :reference="reference" @update="reference.regions = $event" /><p class="field-hint">{{ $t('已有原型：参考截图，局部修改当前代码。只有截图：新建独立原型，不会据此重建原项目源码。') }}</p><p class="field-hint">{{ $t('截图仅在本次对话中保留。执行时会发送给你配置的视觉模型，用于理解参考与修改意见。') }}</p><p v-if="dialogError" class="form-error">{{ $t(dialogError) }}</p><div class="dialog-actions image-actions"><button class="quiet" :disabled="dialogBusy" @click="imageInput.click()">{{ $t('更换截图') }}</button><button v-if="project" class="outline" :disabled="dialogBusy" @click="useReference(true)">{{ $t('以截图新建原型') }}</button><button class="primary" :disabled="dialogBusy" @click="useReference(false)"><ImageIcon :size="16" />{{ project ? $t('用于当前原型') : $t('以截图新建原型') }}</button></div></div>
  <div v-else-if="dialogType === 'spec'" class="spec-dialog"><div class="spec-tabs"><button type="button" :class="{ active: specTab === 'style' }" :disabled="!project" @click="specTab = 'style'">{{ $t('风格') }}</button><button type="button" :class="{ active: specTab === 'spec' }" @click="specTab = 'spec'">{{ $t('规范正文') }}</button><button type="button" :class="{ active: specTab === 'parts' }" @click="specTab = 'parts'">{{ $t('组件库') }}<span class="count">{{ $t(componentList.length) }}</span></button><button type="button" :class="{ active: specTab === 'memory' }" :disabled="!project" @click="specTab = 'memory'">{{ $t('记忆') }}<span class="count">{{ $t(memoryCount) }}</span></button></div><p class="dialog-intro">{{ specTab === 'style' ? $t('这个项目用哪套风格：AI 按它的样子和规矩做页面。换了以后，之后新做的页面和修改按新风格来；已经做好的页面不会自动变样，要换就跟 AI 说「按新风格重做这一页」。') : specTab === 'spec' ? $t('这段文字每次修改都会完整发给模型，是视觉底线。换成你们公司的规范，AI 改出来的就按你们的来——别清空，空的等于没有依据。') : specTab === 'parts' ? $t('这里的组件模型平时只看到清单，要用时才取原文，所以存再多也不拖慢对话。生成大页面时它会照抄你们的结构。') : $t('你说过的长期约定，AI 会自己记下来，对这个项目的所有页面生效，换页也不会忘。不同意的直接删掉。') }}</p><section v-if="specTab === 'style' && project" class="style-shelf"><p v-if="project.style === 'legacy'" class="field-hint style-legacy">{{ $t('这个项目建得早，现在用的是装了的全部 skill。选一套后就只用那一套。') }}</p><StylePicker :model-value="project.style" :styles="styleList" :disabled="dialogBusy" @update:model-value="changeStyle" @import="styleInput.click()" /></section><textarea v-show="specTab === 'spec'" v-model="specDraft" class="spec-editor" :aria-label="$t('设计规范内容')" spellcheck="false"></textarea><p v-if="specNotice" class="spec-notice">{{ $t(specNotice) }}</p><p v-if="dialogError" class="form-error" role="alert">{{ $t(dialogError) }}</p><input ref="specInput" type="file" class="sr-only" accept=".html,.htm,.css,text/html,text/css,text/plain" @change="importSpecTokens" /><div v-show="specTab === 'spec'" class="dialog-actions"><button type="button" class="quiet" :disabled="dialogBusy" @click="specInput.click()">{{ $t('从现有页面读配色') }}</button><button type="button" class="outline" :disabled="dialogBusy || specDraft === specSaved" @click="specDraft = specSaved">{{ $t('放弃改动') }}</button><button class="primary" :disabled="dialogBusy || specDraft === specSaved" @click="saveSpec">{{ $t('保存规范') }}</button></div><p v-show="specTab === 'spec'" class="field-hint">{{ $t('导入的旧原型不会被强制套用本规范——规范里这条的优先级高于全部视觉要求。') }}</p><p v-if="specTab === 'spec' && project && !['none', 'legacy'].includes(project.style)" class="field-hint style-legacy">{{ $t('这个项目选了风格：配色、字号、圆角这些视觉要求听风格的，这里只管内容怎么写和改动约束。没选风格的项目才把这里当全部视觉依据。') }}</p>
    <section v-if="specTab === 'memory' && project" class="memory-shelf"><MemoryPanel :project-id="project.id" @count="memoryCount = $event" /></section>
    <section v-show="specTab === 'parts'" class="component-shelf"><template v-if="skillList.length"><div class="section-label"><span>{{ $t('Skill 包') }}</span><span>{{ $t(skillList.length) }} / 12</span></div><div v-for="item in skillList" :key="item.name" class="skill-row"><div><b>{{ item.name }}</b><small>{{ item.description }}</small><em v-if="item.files.length">{{ $t('{0} 个附带文件 · {1}{2}', [$t(item.files.length), item.files.slice(0, 3).join($t('、')), item.files.length > 3 ? ' …' : '']) }}</em></div><button class="icon-button" :aria-label="$t('卸掉 ') + item.name" :title="$t('卸掉这个 skill')" :disabled="dialogBusy" @click="removeSkill(item.name)"><X :size="13" /></button></div></template><div class="section-label" :style="skillList.length ? 'margin-top:18px' : ''"><span>{{ $t('单个组件') }}</span><span>{{ $t(componentList.length) }} / 40</span></div><p class="field-hint"><code>.html</code> {{ $t('是可照抄的代码，') }}<code>.md</code> {{ $t('是写法说明；整包') }} <code>.zip</code> {{ $t('直接传也行，会自动挑出里面的 html 和 md。每条后面那句用途说明取自文件第一行，它是 AI 判断何时用哪个组件的依据。') }}<br>{{ $t('带') }} <code>SKILL.md</code> {{ $t('的 zip 会按 skill 装上：整包结构原样保留，正文里的相对路径仍然有效。') }}<b>{{ $t('SKILL.md 正文每轮都完整发给 AI，装上就默认生效') }}</b>{{ $t('，不用你再提；它引用的组件库、规范那些大文件仍然按需取。') }}</p><div v-for="item in componentList" :key="item.name" class="component-row"><div><b>{{ item.name }}</b><small>{{ $t(item.kind) }} · {{ item.description }}</small></div><button class="icon-button" :aria-label="$t('移除 ') + item.name" :disabled="dialogBusy" @click="removeComponent(item.name)"><X :size="13" /></button></div><p v-if="!componentList.length" class="field-hint muted-empty">{{ $t('还没有组件。生成大页面时它最管用——AI 会照抄你们的结构，而不是每次自己发明一个。') }}</p><input ref="componentInput" type="file" class="sr-only" accept=".html,.htm,.md,.markdown,.zip,text/html,text/markdown,text/plain,application/zip,application/x-zip-compressed" @change="addComponent" /><button type="button" class="outline full-width" :disabled="dialogBusy" @click="componentInput.click()">{{ $t('导入组件或 skill 包') }}</button></section></div>
  <div v-else-if="dialogType === 'palette'"><section class="property-section token-section"><div class="section-label"><span class="label-with-icon"><Palette :size="15" />{{ $t('项目设计变量') }}</span><span>{{ $t('全局') }}</span></div><p class="field-hint">{{ $t('修改变量，所有引用它的元素一起更新。') }}</p><details><summary><span class="palette-preview"><i v-for="color in colors.slice(0, 6)" :key="color.key" :style="{ background: color.value }"></i></span><span>{{ $t('查看与调整') }}</span><ChevronDown :size="13" /></summary><label v-for="color in colors" :key="color.key" class="token-row"><span>{{ $t(color.label) }}<small>{{ $t(color.key) }}</small></span><div><input type="color" :aria-label="$t('全局{0}', [$t(color.label)])" :value="color.value.length === 7 ? color.value : '#ffffff'" :disabled="locked" @change="edit(color.key, $event.target.value)"><code>{{ color.value }}</code></div></label><p v-if="!Object.keys(sourceInfo.tokens).length" class="field-hint">{{ $t('当前为旧版原型。使用变量时会追加定义，现有视觉保持原样。') }}</p></details></section></div>
  <ModelSettings v-else-if="dialogType === 'settings'" :model="model" :notice="dialogError" v-model:keep-inspector="keepInspector" @saved="model = $event" />
  <form v-else-if="dialogType === 'new'" @submit.prevent="createProject"><p class="dialog-intro">{{ $t('先建立可编辑的页面骨架，再逐步把想法做出来。') }}</p><label>{{ $t('原型名称') }}<input v-model="projectName" autofocus required maxlength="80" :placeholder="$t('例如：订单售后管理')"></label><div class="style-field"><span class="style-label">{{ $t('风格') }}<small>{{ $t('AI 按这套的样子和规矩做页面，之后在「设计规范」里能换') }}</small></span><StylePicker v-model="newStyle" :styles="styleList" :disabled="dialogBusy" @import="styleInput.click()" /><p v-if="specNotice" class="spec-notice">{{ $t(specNotice) }}</p></div><label>{{ $t('你想做什么？') }}<span class="optional">{{ $t('选填') }}</span><textarea v-model="brief" rows="3" :placeholder="$t('为谁设计？页面需要哪些内容、按钮和交互？')"></textarea></label><p class="field-hint">{{ model.has_key ? $t('填写需求后将调用已配置的模型制作第一版。') : $t('尚未连接模型，将先创建骨架。你仍可使用属性面板直接编辑。') }}</p><p v-if="dialogError" class="form-error" role="alert">{{ $t(dialogError) }}</p><div class="dialog-actions"><button class="outline" type="button" :disabled="dialogBusy" @click="closeDialog">{{ $t('取消') }}</button><button class="primary" :disabled="dialogBusy || !projectName.trim()"><LoaderCircle v-if="dialogBusy" class="spin" :size="16" />{{ $t('创建原型') }}</button></div></form>
  <div v-else class="history-content"><p class="dialog-intro">{{ $t('退回历史会生成新版本；保留第一版和最近 100 个版本。') }}</p><div v-if="undoCount" class="manual-summary"><SlidersHorizontal :size="16" />{{ $t('还有 {0} 步修改可撤销，使用顶部撤销按钮。', [$t(undoCount)]) }}</div><div class="version-list"><div v-for="v in [...(page?.versions || [])].reverse()" :key="v.version" class="version-row"><span class="version-node" :class="{ current: v.version === page?.version }"></span><div><b>v{{ $t(v.version) }}<span v-if="v.version === page?.version" class="current-badge">{{ $t('当前基础版本') }}</span></b><p>{{ $t(v.reason) }}</p><time>{{ formatTime(v.created_at) }}</time></div><button class="outline" :disabled="dialogBusy || (v.version === page?.version && !undoCount)" @click="restore(v.version)">{{ $t('退回') }}</button></div></div><p v-if="dialogError" class="form-error" role="alert">{{ $t(dialogError) }}</p></div>
</dialog>
</template>
